  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "飞船必须插入空间插座补充能量，但接入后移动范围会被电缆长度锁住。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Plug in to recharge your energy and manage your resources. Be Careful! Once plugged, you'll only be able to move within the range of your cable!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3234850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "可主动触发慢动作穿越弹幕和狭窄通道，击杀敌人掉落的能量又会为该系统充能。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your ship is equipped with a futuristic Slow-Mo System that you can use almost whenever you want! Luckily for you, it recharges by collecting energy from dead enemies!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3234850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "电池提供 250 多种子弹修饰组合，芯片给予临时强化，飞船还有 40 多项长期构筑选择。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Pick up BATTERIES and discover +250 combinations of bullet modifiers! Get CHIPS of temporary upgrades by destroying enemies! Choose between more than 40 upgrades for your ship.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3234850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
